nsform the reducer","short":"Transducers","main":"One pass, no intermediate arrays.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Intermediate arrays","Transform the reducer","transduce"],"captions":["A chain of map and filter creates a new array at every step","A transducer takes a reducer and returns a reducer: a map transducer applies a function before accumulating; they compose normally","transduce(transformation, reducer, initial, collection): one pass over an array, string or stream"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a0","x":50.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":28.0,"text":"xs","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a1","x":136.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":28.0,"text":"map","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a2","x":222.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":28.0,"text":"filter","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a3","x":308.0,"y":70.0,"w":66.0,"h":28.0,"text":"take","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"text":"each step is a new array","tone":"red","size":9.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["const mapT = (f) => (step) =>","  (acc, x) => step(acc, f(x));","","const filterT = (p) => (step) =>","  (acc, x) => p(x) ? step(acc, x) : acc;"],"hl":[1,4],"lang":"js","size":9.5,"lh":20.0,"w":330.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["const xf = compose(mapT(sq), filterT(odd));","transduce(xf, push, [], nums);"],"hl":[1],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":28.0,"w":330.0}]],"cues":[9.6,30.4]}]},{"title":"RxJS","sub":"Observable, operators, Subject","short":"RxJS","main":"Close the subscription.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Observable","Operators","Subject"],"captions":["Observable is a stream of values over time: you subscribe and unsubscribe; unlike a promise, it has many values","Operators transform streams: map, filter, scan, debounceTime, distinctUntilChanged","Subject is a stream you push values into by hand; close the subscription or memory leaks"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"v0","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":50.0,"h":26.0,"text":"1","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"v1","x":160.0,"y":70.0,"w":50.0,"h":26.0,"text":"2","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"v2","x":250.0,"y":70.0,"w":50.0,"h":26.0,"text":"3","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":40.0,"y1":96.0,"x2":330.0,"y2":96.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"text":"time →","size":9.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":34.0,"lines":["fromEvent(input, 'input').pipe(","  map((e) => e.target.value),","  debounceTime(300),","  distinctUntilChanged(),",").subscribe(search);"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"js","size":10.0,"lh":20.0,"w":330.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["const s = new Subject();","const sub = s.subscribe(log);","s.next(1);","sub.unsubscribe();   // required"],"hl":[3],"lang":"js","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":330.0}]],"cues":[12.5,28.6]}]},{"title":"Combining streams","sub":"switchMap, mergeMap, combineLatest","short":"switchMap","main":"switchMap drops the stale inner stream.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["switchMap","mergeMap and others","combineLatest"],"captions":["For each value switchMap starts an inner stream and drops the previous one: ideal for search as you type","mergeMap runs all in parallel, concatMap one by one, exhaustMap ignores new ones until the old one ends","combineLatest joins the latest values, merge mixes streams; retry, catchError and takeUntil handle errors and completion"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"o","x":80.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":24.0,"text":"a    ab    abc","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r1","x":80.0,"y":100.0,"w":60.0,"h":22.0,"text":"query a","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r2","x":160.0,"y":100.0,"w":60.0,"h":22.0,"text":"query ab","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r3","x":250.0,"y":100.0,"w":70.0,"h":22.0,"text":"que